plugin-hostd-protocol (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version-check: compare the changelog version without a CI snapshot suffix
  * CI: build and test in three containers, ABI check, fuzz; release through
    the shared RPM and DEB workflows
  * One licence file: COPYING, the GNU GPL v3 text the packaging names (the
    initial LICENSE was the same text)
  * install: the scenario runner's source and the protocol page beside the
    corpus
  * install-check: name every install directory, so a caller's LIBDIR does
    not move the scratch install
  * Makefile: the sanitized tests build under a distribution's _FORTIFY_SOURCE
  * protocol_parse: run only the callback of the verb the message names
    (plugin-hostd#372)
  * format_number: write NaN, Infinity and -Infinity (plugin-hostd#371)
  * Import mod-host's protocol code as libplugin-hostd-protocol 0.1.0
  * Initial commit

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:04:52 +0000
